                          <p class="is-size-3 has-text-weight-bold mt-6">Welcome to the Hogle Lab!</p>
                          <p class="is-size-6 mt-6">We are a research group in <a href="https://www.abo.fi/en/study-subject/environmental-and-marine-biology/">Environmental and Marine Biology</a> at <a href="https://www.abo.fi/en/">Åbo Akademi University</a> and affiliated with the <a href="https://www.utu.fi/en/university/faculty-of-science/biology">Biology Department</a> at the <a href="https://www.utu.fi/en">University of Turku.</a></p>
